{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/Crab_Peoples_0_global.png?t=1751357480\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Super Kingcrab Simulator</strong> is a third-person destruction action (semi) open-world adventure game where you become a mighty king crab, liberate countless kidnapped crabs, and lay waste to major cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become a giant and powerful Super Kingcrab\u2014smash buildings, destroy crab restaurants, and rescue your fellow crabs.</strong><br>Progress through the chaos and ultimately destroy the cities to escape the world of humanity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/Crab_Peoples_1_global.png?t=1751357480\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/YDKK_Tumb_GIF_0.gif?t=1751357480\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are the most powerful of all king crabs \u2014 the <strong>Super Kingcrab</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy buildings and strip humans of their shelters!<br>Rip out the ruins and hurl them to devastate nearby towns and cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are so many targets around you waiting to be destroyed...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/Crab_Peoples_2_global.png?t=1751357480\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/YDKK_Tumb_GIF_1.gif?t=1751357480\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't destroy buildings and fight humans all by yourself...<br><strong>Because a king crab is never alone. There are many of you\u2014many crabs!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You <strong>must</strong> liberate the others.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The crabs will fight by your side\u2026<br>Free one crab, and it will help you free more.<br>Work together to liberate even more king crabs somewhere out there\u2026!!<br>And together, let's bring total ruin to this hellish world!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/Crab_Peoples_3_global.png?t=1751357480\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's a great question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our protagonist\u2026 the <strong>Super Kingcrab</strong>, <br>set out on a journey after noticing that many of his kind were mysteriously disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>But during his journey, he witnessed something truly horrifying\u2026</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/20250601005258_1.jpg?t=1751357480\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A city where humans were eating king crabs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, our king crab has a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To prevent more crabs from being devoured, he must destroy the crab restaurants.<br>And he must annihilate the cities of the humans who feasted on his kin \u2014 by any means necessary.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Building 50% Sale!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773390/da4514f86bdb54174c3225c1f77daed2c9bc2d5b.jpg"},{"name":"Building 100% Sale!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773390/78803ef38c813a15cd981807d4074ab83a36ac33.jp